<span style="height: 30px; padding: 0 12px; border-radius: 15px; background: rgba(255,196,0,0.12); color: #F5F5F2; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700"><svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="11" width="14" height="10" rx="2"></rect><path d="M8 11V8a4 4 0 0 1 8 0v3"></path></svg>صاحب المحل فقط</span>
